		"en": [
			"• From \"Mobile New Century GundamX\", GundamX's expansion machine, GundamX Divider, is now available in the HG series. ■ Equipped with a gimmick that transforms from Seal to harmonica cannon. ■Added accessory parts such as beam machine gun and hyper bazooka that bring out the charm of MS. Molded product x 9, foil seal x 1, assembly manual"
